title: Kirby: Nightmare in Dream Land
year: 2002
notes: Remake of the NES Kirby's Adventure. A huge bounty of beautiful animations with lots of appeal. The joy is discovering the distinct feel of all the powers. Gameplay is a bit simple. There isn't really a progressive difficulty curve. Good for children.
play until: Complete 4/9 levels, and then continue if you're still having fun.

